{
  "id": 143301135,
  "iid": 6355,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "column-utils: Add missing check for frame_data::has_ts",
  "description": "Fixes: #17980\n\nAdds check for frame_data::has_ts in col_set_delta_time before calling\nset_time_seconds. This is the same check that is done in multiple other \nmethods in this file. Because frame_data::tsprec might not be initialized \nif has_ts is false, this resulted in a failed assertion in set_time_seconds \nif the user created a column with \"Delta time\".\n\nAlso adds an assertion for frame_data::has_ts in set_time_seconds.",
  "state": "merged",
